      <Docs>
        <summary>
          <para>The app has not be used for several days and/or is unlikely to be used for several days. Apps in this bucket will have more restrictions, including network restrictions, except during certain short periods (at a minimum, once a day) when they are allowed to execute jobs, access the network, etc.</para>
          <para><format type="text/html"><a href="https://developer.android.com/reference/android/app/usage/UsageStatsManager#STANDBY_BUCKET_RARE" title="Reference documentation">Android reference for <code>android.app.usage.UsageStatsManager.STANDBY_BUCKET_RARE</code>.</a></format></para>
